00:19:37.150 --> 00:19:39.530
I decided to start riding motorcycles.

00:19:39.530 --> 00:19:42.740
At first, I didn't even know what a license was.

00:19:42.740 --> 00:19:45.330
Getting a license was hard.

00:19:45.330 --> 00:19:47.410
Oh, yeah! What's also hard is that

00:19:47.410 --> 00:19:50.000
