00:21:00.110 --> 00:21:01.150
Chisame-chan?

00:21:02.610 --> 00:21:05.160
You don't ride bikes to get laughed at.

00:21:06.950 --> 00:21:07.820
Look.

00:21:08.200 --> 00:21:10.740
This is how you ride a bike.

00:21:10.740 --> 00:21:12.450
Hang on!

00:21:12.450 --> 00:21:15.540
And turn super tight at the S-curves.

00:21:15.540 --> 00:21:17.040
At the last corner,

00:21:17.040 --> 00:21:19.460
