00:21:19.750 --> 00:21:21.420
The final straight!

00:21:21.420 --> 00:21:24.380
Get low to reduce drag.

00:21:24.720 --> 00:21:26.800
And finally...

00:21:27.300 --> 00:21:29.720
Gooooal!

00:21:29.720 --> 00:21:33.270
A sport that uses your whole
body and all your senses.

00:21:33.270 --> 00:21:35.690
That's biking!

